    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Clarke Auctioneers Ltd are delighted to bring to market 7 Belview Court, a superb 4-bed family home nestled in the highly sought-after location of Belview Court in Wicklow Town. This beautifully situated and surprisingly spacious (122 sq.m 1,313 sq.ft) family home comprises of a stunning open plan kitchen/dining and family room, a light filled living room, as well as a large utility Room and WC on the ground floor. Upstairs there are four well appointed bedrooms (1 ensuite) as well as a large family bathroom. The property sits in an elevated position overlooking Wicklow Town and has the most panoramic views over the the harbour, Wicklow Bay and the spectacular Wicklow coastline towards Dublin and beyond. The property has just been completely redecorated throughout but there is plenty of scope to put your own stamp on this fine family home. Windows are double glazed and there is Oil Fired central heating.\n\nNo. 7 is situated on an elevated site towards the the end of a quiet cul de sac. To the front there is a concrete parking area. There is gated side access to rear on two sides. A large side garden offers the possibility to extend the property in the future. The private and secure west facing rear garden includes a large raised deck with spectacular views. The decking area is accessed via double doors from the kitchen/living/dining room and is a real suntrap that offers the perfect setting for alfresco dining and entertaining throughout the afternoon and long into the summer evenings.\n\nSituated in a mature and quiet cul-de-sac, 7 Belview Court is a mere 500 metres from Wicklow Main Street. Residents enjoy immediate access to an array of shops, restaurants, pubs and essential services including primary and secondary schools. The property is conveniently located for easy access to the M11/M50. Wicklow train station is a ten-minute walk away. The excellent bus service to Dublin passes within a short distance of the house. \nWicklow town is a vibrant and growing seaside town. Belview Court is within easy reach of beautiful Wicklow Harbour, the Silver Strand, Magheramore, Brittas Bay and numerous scenic mountain and sea-side walks.\n\n7 Belview Court truly offers the best of both worlds: a tranquil, private retreat, with the vibrant life of Wicklow Town right on your doorstep. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
